'''Scratch''' is a [[Legendary Weapons|legendary]] knife that was originally obtainable by unboxing it from the [[2016 Halloween box|Halloween Box]] during the [[Halloween Event 2016|2016 Halloween Event]]. It is now only obtainable through trading as the event has since ended.

== Appearance ==
The knife is pitch black in color with a blood red guard and four red scratches on the blade, hence its name.

== Trivia ==
*It has a [[Scratch (2017)|blue reskin]] under the same name from the [[Halloween Event 2017|2017 Halloween Event]], making the [https://murder-mystery-2.fandom.com/wiki/Murder_Mystery_2_Wiki:Wiki-Bot/Scratch_Set Scratch Set].
*This knife was obtained from the first Halloween event [[Boxes|box]] ever in [[Murder Mystery 2]].
*According to a [https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=-myf9reUbH8 JD] video, this knife was designed by [https://www.roblox.com/users/96320956/profile Marsabar].

